{"id":"e3886f8e5c8d0f18","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy.md","title":"Incompleteness Hierarchy","display":"df-incompleteness-hierarchy — Incompleteness Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy","aliases":["92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy"],"display":"df-incompleteness-hierarchy — Incompleteness Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]"],"source":"本地反射与相容性进展扩展；对照原书第 IX 章 pp.106–110 的 HBL/Löb 背景；该 PDF 不定义这些完整模式或 Turing 进展","source_status":"原书之外的证明论扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-incompleteness-hierarchy — Incompleteness Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" href=\"?note=3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" title=\"92-df-iterated-consistency\">92-df-iterated-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" href=\"?note=2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" title=\"92-df-recursive-axiomatization\">92-df-recursive-axiomatization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地反射与相容性进展扩展；对照原书第 IX 章 pp.106–110 的 HBL/Löb 背景；该 PDF 不定义这些完整模式或 Turing 进展"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书之外的证明论扩展"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (base theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\)</span> (recursive axiomatizability ensuring the finite consistency progression is defined)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (iterated-consistency progression, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" href=\"?note=3ccc8054e82f6b5d\" title=\"92-df-iterated-consistency\">92-df-iterated-consistency</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncLevel}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{IncLevel}_G\\)</span> (definition-target incompleteness-at-level predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IncLevel}_G(T,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\nT^{(n)}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\varphi\\notin T^{(n)}\\land\\neg\\varphi\\notin T^{(n)}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IncLevel}_G(T,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\nT^{(n)}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\varphi\\notin T^{(n)}\\land\\neg\\varphi\\notin T^{(n)}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不完备性层级：不断添加一致性</li>\n<li>本定义只判断给定层<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{(n)}\">\\(T^{(n)}\\)</span>是否存在一个既不属于该理论、其否定也不属于该理论的句子</li>\n<li>添加前层的内部一致性句并闭合得到新层；这不自动保证新层相容</li>\n<li>若各层持续满足相容性、有效性与足够算术强度，则本质不完备性给出每层不完备</li>\n<li>“层级严格递增”还需前层不能证明自身一致性且后层保持相容等条件；“Turing完备性层级”与这里的证明论一致性迭代不是同一概念</li>\n<li>不存在相容、有效可公理化、含足够算术且句法完备的扩张；去掉这些限定则存在完备理论</li>\n<li>不完备性的&quot;深度&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"3ccc8054e82f6b5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (base theory, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"3ccc8054e82f6b5d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ (iterated-consistency progression, see [[92-df-iterated-consistency]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncLevel}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IncLevel}_G(T,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\nT^{(n)}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\varphi\\notin T^{(n)}\\land\\neg\\varphi\\notin T^{(n)}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"T^{(n)}","display":false}],"bytes":2001,"backlinks":[{"id":"1e2b0ebca4f5fffb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-incompleteness-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["3ccc8054e82f6b5d","90f32e29c9d553ed","2f9850d6fe4ddc35"]}